{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-grove-iman-developers-dubai-hills","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":598,"crm_id":"819","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"The Grove","slug":"the-grove-iman-developers-dubai-hills","display_address":"Dubai Hills Estate","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"IMAN Developers","price":1690000,"display_price":"1.69M","lattitude":25.1105625,"longitude":55.2492376,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Grove is a premium residential complex from the developer Iman Developers, which includes <strong>studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms</strong> in its collection. The undoubted advantage of this project is its location in the Dubai Hills area - one of the most environmentally friendly, a significant part of which is made up of parks and gardens. The main transport interchanges are located near the complex, providing quick and easy access to socially important facilities (schools, hospitals) and other places in Dubai:</p><ul><li>1 kilometer to Dubai Hills Mall;</li><li>7 kilometers to the Mall of the Emirates;</li><li>16 kilometers to the Burj Khalifa tower and the artificial island of Palm Jumeirah;</li><li>26 kilometers to Dubai Expo City;</li><li>28 kilometers to Dubai International Airport.</li></ul><p>Residents will enjoy modern amenities, open spaces and natural light - with floor-to-ceiling windows in each apartment offering breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape.</p><p>The Grove by Iman is an ideal place to live for any modern person who prefers a calm atmosphere of comfortable country life.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/819/images/2024/01/29/r5BZYQsAyeXBPCGBBDRbL7